[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

Large yellow cat who patrols the forest for food. They are the animal with the most Agility in the game.

They normally should run away from you, but have a good chance to [[execute]] you if they decide to aggro.

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

They behave extremely strangely, unlike any other aggressive animal: they will flee within a certain radius of a player, then charge seemingly out of nowhere and only initiate combat at the very last second. Very agile will likely hit twice or more for every attack you make

